  title="Why the Same Models Always Show Up in Stripchat's Popular — And How a Newcomer Can Break In"
  description="Stripchat's Popular category has a well-documented bias toward already-large rooms. Here's why it happens, what Stripchat has actually done about it, and the concrete paths a new model has to real visibility."
